==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*5 [[Firecracker]]s (400%) spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Firecracker]]s (400%) spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Firecracker]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Firecracker]]s (400%) spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
**40 [[Firecracker]]s (400%) spawn, delay 0.67~3.33 seconds<sup>20f~100f</sup>.
**20 [[Firecracker]]s (400%) spawn, delay 0.67~3.33 seconds<sup>20f~100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A rather easy stage, just bring the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] for an easy win.

